# esbuild, not importmap

Front-end JS is a bundled ESM graph. Entry is `app/javascript/application.js`. Output is `app/assets/builds/application.js`. Stimulus controllers register explicitly in `app/javascript/controllers/index.js`.

```ruby
# bad
gem "importmap-rails"
# layout
<%= javascript_importmap_tags %>
```

```ruby
# good
gem "jsbundling-rails"
# layout
<%= javascript_include_tag "application", "data-turbo-track": "reload", type: "module" %>
```

Do not add `config/importmap.rb` or `bin/importmap`. Do not use `@hotwired/stimulus-loading` or `eagerLoadControllersFrom`.
